{"id":"bagarre","lemma":"bagarre","pos":"noun","rank":1979,"glosses":["brawl, fight"],"ipa":"/ba.ɡaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/Fr-bagarre.ogg/Fr-bagarre.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bagarres"},"formAudio":{"bagarres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-bagarres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je déteste la bagarre.","en":"I hate fighting.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Qui a commencé la bagarre ?","en":"Who started the fight?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"J'ai vu une bagarre.","en":"I saw a fight.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La police a mis fin à la bagarre.","en":"The police broke up the fight.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"end, close, finish"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"a la"]]},{"text":"Il est ici pour chercher la bagarre.","en":"He's here trying to stir up trouble.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to look for, to seek"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}